port sysutils/wander
type port
reason "DragonFly: vendored containerd/console and moby/term lack DragonFly (dragonfly/@<line> patches)"

# dragonfly/@<line>/patch-vendor_*: the vendored containerd/console
# (v1.0.4-0.20230313162750-1ae8d489ac81) has no DragonFly termios/pty code
# (undefined checkConsole, newMaster), and moby/term (v0.5.0) treats
